  ($qb$S17C09Q09$qb$, $qb$S17$qb$, $qb$C09$qb$, $qb$L$qb$, $qb$Insurance and contingency fund adequacy for significant adverse events in your organisation is:$qb$, $qb$Strong — insurance coverage and contingency reserves are adequate for the identified risk profile$qb$, $qb$Generally adequate — core risks are insured$qb$, $qb$Partially adequate — some risk coverage exists but gaps are known$qb$, $qb$Inadequate — insurance and contingency reserves are insufficient for the organisation's risk exposure$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, true),
