  ($qb$S19C08Q09$qb$, $qb$S19$qb$, $qb$C08$qb$, $qb$L+MM$qb$, $qb$Post-improvement measurement (tracking whether CX improvements actually improved the experience) in your organisation is:$qb$, $qb$Rigorous — all CX improvements are measured against defined outcomes$qb$, $qb$Generally adequate — major CX improvements are measured$qb$, $qb$Limited — some measurement of CX improvement impact occurs without consistent rigour$qb$, $qb$Non-existent — CX improvements are implemented without measuring their impact$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, true),
